# Local staging area for built release artifacts.
#
# Builds reach people through Google Play, and any sideload APK reaches them as
# a GitHub Release asset uploaded to a tag -- never committed. This repo exists
# to stay small and source-free, and a tracked APK per version would undo that.
# Build into releases/, upload from it, and let git ignore it entirely.
releases/

/build/

/build/
